 ing Lake Norman State Park their Oasis Spaces traveling exhibit.\n\nTo con
 tinue the celebrate Juneteenth all month long\, stop by our auditorium to 
 learn all about The Negro Motorist Green Book. Each display panel highligh
 ts a North Carolina business owner and traveler.
