DESCRIPTION:We are proud to be a Blue Star Museum [again] in 2026! Active m
 ilitary personnel and up to five family members can visit the CSS Neuse Mu
 seum for free from May 16 (Armed Forces Day) through September 7 (Labor Da
 y). We appreciate your service and can’t wait for you to visit! \n\nBlue
  Star Museums is a partnership between the National Endowment for the Arts
  and Blue Star Families\, in collaboration with the Department of War and 
 museums across America\, offering free admission to the nation’s active-
 duty military personnel and their families\, including National Guard and 
 Reserve. \n\nHere is a link to other museums in North Carolina that partic
 ipate in the Blue Star Museums program: https://www.arts.gov/blue-star-mus
 eums-map?state=NC#bsm-map \;\n\nIf you have any questions\, please call 25
 2-526-9600\, ext. 221.
GEO:35.260403;-77.581573
