 h Carolina!\n\nJoin us on June 13\, 2026\, for the Circa 1850 Slave Quarte
 rs and Far Cemetery tour. This structure (pictured) was renovated and move
 d from its original location on the site of the antebellum Meadows Farm\, 
 now the intersection of Dr. Martin Luther King\, Jr. Blvd. and Neuse Blvd.
 \, to Howell Rd. behind the Coastal Carolina Regional Airport.\n\nThis sit
 e is also where the Far Cemetery is located where 522 graves of Freedmen w
 ere buried during the Civil War. American history\, in our backyard!
