DTSTART:20260615T140000Z
DTEND:20260615T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Come celebrate the summer at Merch
 ants Millpond State Park with our 4th year of the Summer Junior Adventure 
 Series! In this series\, we have a different topic that we teach about eve
 ry Monday at 10 AM throughout the summer. \n\nThis week we'll talk about t
 he often overlooked macroinvertebrates we have here at the Millpond! These
  tiny critters are rarely given a second thought but they contribute to th
 e ecosystem in a big way! Whether its forming the backbone of the food web
 \, or being an indicator for certain things\, these creatures are worth ta
 king a look at\, so come join us as we look more at our macroinvertebrates
 !  \n\nThis program will start promptly at 10 AM at the visitor center. Gu
 ests are encouraged to dress for the weather as part of this program will 
 be outside. This program will involve dip netting at the boat launch and p
 articpates usually get a little wet in the process.
GEO:36.437278;-76.701271
LOCATION:Merchants Millpond State Park\, Visitor Center
SUMMARY:Ranger Cody' Marvelous Macroinvertebrates
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/ranger-cody-marvelous-macroi
 nvertebrates
