DESCRIPTION:Join Ranger Carson and hike up Moore's Wall to the fire tower a
 nd enjoy watching the beautiful sunrise. This will be a unique experience 
 and a perfect way to start your day.\n\nThe hike up to the fire tower is s
 trenuous and has uneven terrain. A headlamp and/or flashlight is recommend
 ed as we will be doing a large portion of the hike in the dark—before th
 e sun rises. As always\, make sure to bring lots of water\, snacks\, close
 d toed shoes\, and weather appropriate clothing. Initially\, we will be me
 eting at the park front gate as the park will not be open yet. \n\nTo sign
  up for this hike and for additional information\, email carson.orton@ncpa
 rks.gov.
GEO:36.395044;-80.266541
LOCATION:Hanging Rock State Park\, Park's Main Gate
SUMMARY:Earning the Sunrise 
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/earning-the-sunrise
