DESCRIPTION:Sea Turtles: Happy World Sea Turtle Day! Join us at the park to
  learn about our North Carolina sea turtles and what we do here at the par
 k to help protect these species. We will finish with a turtle-ly awesome c
 raft to take home. NOTE: program is at Bear Island Concession Stand. You w
