 ica’s 250th year through traditional craft workshops. Join us to learn f
 rom local craftspeople and experience traditional handwork crafts that hav
 e been practiced throughout American History. This event was made possible
  using America 250 NC grand funds provided by the North Carolina Departmen
 t of Natural and Cultural Resources. \n\nRegistration is required. There a
 re 18 seats available.
