DESCRIPTION:West Marion Inc. is proud to announce its 5th Annual Juneteenth
  Celebration at Lake James State Park\, taking place June 19\, 2026\, desi
 gned to honor the historic significance of Juneteenth while bringing the c
 ommunity together in celebration\, reflection\, and fellowship. Join us at
  the Paddy's Creek Beach for a day of music\, canoe trips\, guided hikes\,
