DTEND:20260620T010000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 9th Annual Juneteenth Celebration in Moore Coun
 ty as we come together to honor freedom\, culture\, community\, and the ri
 ch history of Juneteenth through music\, art\, food\, and fellowship. This
  exciting two-day celebration will feature live entertainment\, African dr
 umming\, storytelling\, spoken word\, local artistry\, food vendors\, fami
 ly activities\, bounce houses\, open gym\, community engagement\, and so m
 uch more.\n\nOn Thursday\, June 19\, celebrate with us at the West Souther
 n Pines Center located at 1250 West New York Avenue\, Southern Pines\, NC 
 from 4 PM to 9 PM. The celebration continues on Friday\, June 20 at Cardin
 al Park located at 657 S Walnut St\, Pinebluff\, NC 28373 from 2 PM to 9 P
 M.\n\nThis family-friendly event welcomes all ages and creates a vibrant a
 tmosphere where the community can gather\, connect\, celebrate heritage\, 
 and enjoy live performances and cultural experiences together. Whether you
  come for the music\, the vendors\, the food\, or the fellowship\, there i
 s something for everyone to enjoy. Vending opportunities are still availab
 le.\n\nBring your family\, invite your friends\, and join us as we celebra
 te freedom\, unity\, and community spirit at one of Moore County’s most 
 anticipated summer traditions.\n\nFreedom. Culture. Community. Together We
  Thrive.
GEO:35.184312;-79.40603
LOCATION: West Southern Pines Center\, The Auditorium
SUMMARY:Moore County Juneteenth Celebration
