DESCRIPTION:Join Wake Up and Read to celebrate the beginning of a reading-f
 illed summer! Enjoy food\, fun\, books and a "meet and hear" read aloud fr
 om award-winning team\, author Kelly Starling Lyons and illustrator E.B. L
 ewis\, and Caitlin Gooch\, Saddle Up and Read founder and equestrian of th
 e newly released children's book\, Riding Magic. \n\nSpecial appearance fr
 om Ardent who was the model for the horse featured in the book. \n\nGet re
 ady for activities for kids\, storytime and a special Juneteenth visit to 
 a local family-owned farm.\n\nRegister at: bit.ly/3ZgWBRF\n\nDonate a book
  for a family that attends: https://tinyurl.com/54m9bhjy\n\nHappy Juneteen
 th!
