 estival starting immediately after from\, 12am-4pm. Location being the 100
 0-1300 block of Broad St. (Generally known as the Five Points area).\n\nRe
 gistration is now open for Parade participants\, and vendors of all kind f
 or our City of New Bern Sponsored Festival! Checkout our website for signu
 ps and details at www.jonb1865.org\, and we look forward to seeing you the
 re!\n\nAnd don't forget to check out our 1st Military Basketball Tournamen
 t happening that day as well at 601 3rd Ave. (New Stanley White Recreation
  Center). Along with finishing the night off with our amazing Fireworks Sh
 ow at 901 Chapman St. (Henderson Park) at 8:30pm!
