DESCRIPTION:Black Perspectives of the Founding Era: Black Agency\nSaturday\
 , June 20\, 2026 | 12:00 p.m. – 1:00 p.m.\nAycock Recreation Center | He
 nderson\, NC\n\nJoin an open discussion exploring Black perspectives and a
 gency during America's founding era\, as part of Vance County's America 25
 0 commemoration. Free admission. Space is limited to 25 participants — r
 egistration required by Friday\, June 12\, 2026 at https://hvrpd.recdesk.c
 om/Community/Home.\n\nFor more information\, contact Shawn Somerville at (
 252) 438-3160 or shawnsomerville@henderson.nc.gov.\n\nPresented by Henders
 on-Vance Recreation & Parks in partnership with America 250.
