DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Come celebrate the summer at Merch
 ants Millpond State Park with our 4th year of the Summer Junior Adventure 
 Series! In this series\, we have a different topic that we teach about eve
 ry Monday at 10 AM throughout the summer. \n\nThis week its all about camp
 ing! Everyone loves camping\, but not many people know how to plan and pac
 k for it. Join us as we cover what supplies you'll need to camp\, skills n
 eeded\, and  best practices. If you've ever had any questions about campin
 g or gear\, then this is program you've been waiting for!\n\nThis program 
 will start promptly at 10 AM at the visitor center. Guests are encouraged 
 to dress for the weather as part of this program will be outside.
GEO:36.437278;-76.701271
