DESCRIPTION:Bird Cruise: Climb aboard for a guided bird cruise exploring th
 e rich estuarine habitats around Hammocks Beach State Park. This ranger le
 d event will help you identify wading birds\, shorebirds\, raptors\, and s
 easonal migrants along the way. Bring your binoculars and curiosity as we 
 cruise through some of the best birding spots on the water! Limited to 11 
 participants\, sign-up is required. Contact the park to register. 910-326 
 4881.
GEO:34.670531;-77.143056
LOCATION:Hammocks Beach State Park
