DESCRIPTION:Join us for a tour of the Moravian Archives Vault featuring the
  collection materials from the Revolutionary War and early American Histor
 y!\n\nGuests will walk through the Archives Vault which contains millions 
 of records from the settlement of the Moravians here in North Carolina in 
 the 1750s on. Highlighted items will include correspondence from George Wa
 shington\, the Fourth of July Proclamation\, maps\, congressional records 
 and much\, much more!\n\nLearn about Moravian History and the creation of 
 our nation while seeing how such collection materials are preserved for ou
 r posterity!
