DESCRIPTION:The Patriot (2000) - A widowed farmer\, with a brave but brutal
  military past\, decides not to join up when the British arrive in 1776. H
 owever\, when his son enlists and is later captured by the enemy\, the for
 mer soldier must abandon his new-found pacifist principles in order to res
 cue his eldest child. He forms a regiment of Carolina patriots whose guerr
 illa tactics prove pivotal to the US war effort.
GEO:36.217783;-81.682794
LOCATION:Appalachian Theatre of the High Country
SUMMARY:Film Screening: "The Patriot" (2000)
