DESCRIPTION:In the spirit of celebrating America’s 250th birthday in 2026
 \, we invite you to be part of the Town of Troutman’s 21st Annual Indepe
 ndence Day Parade\, brought to you by the Troutman Ruritan Club! As the on
 ly Independence Day Parade in Iredell County\, we welcome churches\, busin
 esses\, organizations\, civic groups\, and community members to join the c
 elebration.\n\n📅 Saturday\, June 27\n⏰ 11:00 AM\n\nThe parade route w
 ill travel down Main Street / US Hwy 21 through downtown Troutman\, beginn
 ing at the Iredell County Fairgrounds and ending at the American Legion Po
 st (401 Main St.).\n\n🚨 Parade applications must be received by Friday\
 , June 19.\n\nThere is no fee to participate\, and we encourage everyone t
 o get involved—whether as a participant or a spectator!\n\nApplications 
 should be submitted online when possible. A paper application is available
  if needed.\n\nWhen completing your application\, please be as descriptive
  as possible about your vehicle(s) and entry details\, as this information
  helps us plan the parade lineup. If anything about your entry changes aft
 er submission\, please contact Amber so the lineup can be updated accordin
 gly.\n\n📧 Questions? Email award@troutmannc.gov\n\nWe look forward to c
 elebrating with you and making this year’s parade the best one yet! 🎉
 \n\nThank you to our Title Sponsor- Troutman Ruritan Club!
LOCATION:Downtown Troutman
SUMMARY:21st Annual Independence Day Parade
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/21st-annual-independence-day
 -parade
