DESCRIPTION:Join us at Mayo River State Park for a Strawberry Moon Night Hi
 ke!\n\nOriginating from Native American tradition\, marking the time when 
 strawberries are fully ripe for the season\, the Strawberry Moon is the fu
 ll moon of June and coincides with the beginning of the summer season in t
 he Northern Hemisphere. \n\nThis hike will be along the 2-mile Mayo Mounta
 in Loop\; an easy-moderate hike with plenty of foliage and a steady inclin
 e. Please bring water\, hiking shoes\, and flashlights.\n\nEvent is subjec
 t to cancel due to poor weather. Please click the "I'm Interested" button 
 as event will cancel when there are no registrations and recieve emails if
  canceled due to weather.
