DESCRIPTION:Explore how North Carolina helped forge a new nation during one
  of the most transformative periods in history. Through maps\, historical 
 documents\, and everyday objects\, this exhibit reveals the state’s role
  in the struggle for independence\, from early protests against British ru
 le and the battles fought on Carolina soil to the drafting of the Constitu
 tion. Forging a Nation invites visitors to witness how ordinary people\, c
 onflict\, and conviction shaped North Carolina's history during the Americ
 an Revolution.
GEO:35.596641;-82.55485
LOCATION:Pack Memorial Library
SUMMARY:Forging A Nation Exhibit
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/forging-a-nation-exhibit
