DTSTART:20260630T220000Z
DTEND:20260630T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:A study of 6 small battles in the Carolina backcountry in 1780-
 81 that have been largely overlooked by modern historians of the American 
 Revolution.  Without Patriot victories at these six battles\, the outcome 
 of the American Revolution may well have ended in British/Loyalist victori
 es.  Arguably\, major battles such as King’s Mountain\, Cowpens\, the Ra
 ce for the Dan\, Guilford Court House\, and Yorktown might never have occu
 rred. \n\nThe outcome of the American Revolution had its birth in the Caro
 lina Backcountry.
GEO:35.571985;-82.555146
LOCATION:Asheville Museum of History at the Historic Smith-McDowell House
SUMMARY:Broken Links in the Chain: Critical Battles in the Carolina Backcou
 ntry
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/broken-links-in-the-chain-cr
 itical-battles-in-the-carolina-backcountry
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
END:VEVENT
