DESCRIPTION:Celebrate our nation's 250th birthday with "America’s Sweethe
 arts" as they bring timeless music to the Wake Forest Renaissance Centre s
 tage.\n\nThis charming\, vintage vocal trio delivers polished three-part h
 armonies\, stylish period costumes\, and a love for the songs that helped 
 define a nation. Featuring swing\, jazz\, and Broadway favorites\, their p
 erformance honors American musical heritage with warmth\, energy\, and hea
 rt.\n\nAudiences of all ages will enjoy this nostalgic and uplifting tribu
 te to the sounds that shaped generations. \n\nPlease contact the Box Offic
 e for any ADA or accessibility services needed. Staff are available M-F fr
 om 9 a.m.– 12 p.m.\; 1-5 p.m.\n\nEmail: rcboxoffice@wakeforestnc.gov\n\n
