DESCRIPTION:The Charlotte Hawkins Brown Museum is hosting it's annual Schoo
 l Supply Drive July 1st-August 31st! School supply donations are accepted 
 at the Visitor Center Tues-Sat from 9am-5pm! All donations are welcome and
  will go to Sedalia Elementary School to support our local students! The f
 ollowing items are needed:\n\n \n\nCrayons or Colored Pencils\nGlue Sticks
 \nSafety Scissors \nDry Erase Markers \nSpiral/Composition Notebooks\nZipl
 oc Bags\nPencil Top Erasers\nPencils\nPronged Folders\nTissues\nBookbags (
