DESCRIPTION:Celebrate America's Birthday and also the history of Gaston Cou
 nty\nwith a Gaston County 250 parade representing our local cities and tow
 ns\,\nhistorical groups\, and local history organizations. The parade begi
 ns at 2:00 pm at Ingles.\n\nPre-parade events begin at the Gaston County M
