 30 pm until 9:30 pm\, there will be a live performance at the park's amphi
 theater by Chris Taylor & The Rumor\, as well as The Resistance. \n\nImmed
 iately afterward\, there will be a pyrotechnic fireworks performance\, the
  biggest one the region has to offer.\n\nPlease join us as we celebrate th
 e 250th birthday of our great and proud nation!\n\nOn a side note\, the pa
 rk is located on the site of the previous county high school\, which opene
