 campus Old Football Field - 201 Allen Ln\, Louisburg\, NC 27549\n\nActivit
 ies:\n\nFood TrucksInflatablesGamesMusicFireworks (at dark)\n Please note:
  No glass\, alcohol\, pets\, smoking\, tents\, stakes\, or shade structure
 s are allowed on the school campus.  Both regular and accessible parking (
 by identification only) will be available in designated areas on the campu
 ses of Louisburg High School. Parking is prohibited on private property. I
 n addition\, some parking lots in the area may appear to be public\, when 
 in fact they are private. Due to the high volume of attendees expected\, a
 rea residents are encouraged to make plans with family members and friends
  to carpool to Louisburg High School.\n\nSome additional security measures
  will be in place\, such as: \n\nSecurity wands will be utilized at the tw
 o entrances. Clear bags will be required when entering the premises NO WEA
