DESCRIPTION:To celebrate the Fourth of July\, Kill Devil Hill's hosts a fir
 eworks show. In honor of America’s 250th\, the 2026 fireworks display wi
 ll be bigger than before! Fireworks are launched from the end of a popular
  fishing pier in the center of Kill Devil Hill's.\n\n \n\nResidents and vi
 sitors are invited to visit one of our many beach accesses\, where beach c
 hairs can be set up to watch the spectacular show. \n\n \n\nFireworks have
  long been a national symbol of Independence Day\, representing both celeb
 ration and remembrance\, and it provides a shared civic experience that br
 ings the community together as we publicly commemorate the signing of the 
 Declaration of Independence.\n\n \n\nFor more information visit: https://w
 ww.kdhnc.com/1014/Special-Events
GEO:36.044242;-75.674482
LOCATION:Kill Devil Hills
SUMMARY:Town of Kill Devil Hills: Independence Day Fireworks Show
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/town-of-kill-devil-hills-ind
 ependence-day-fireworks-show
