DTSTART:20260706T150000Z
DTEND:20260706T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join a ranger to learn about our very own state reptile! We wil
 l hike in search of these turtles as part of our survey for the Box Turtle
  Connection—a 100-year study helping us better understand this species. 
 For more information\, visit https://boxturtle.uncg.edu. Meet on the back 
 porch of the Visitor Center. Hike: 0.5 miles\, easy.
GEO:34.670531;-77.143056
LOCATION:Hammocks Beach State Park
SUMMARY:Box Turtle trek
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/box-turtle-trek-8561
