DESCRIPTION:On July 8\, Americans in every U.S. state and territory will ga
 ther to read the Declaration of Independence simultaneously. Spanning mult
 iple time zones and thousands of miles\, this nationwide event commemorate
 s the 250th anniversary of the Declaration's printing and distribution thr
 oughout the colonies. In North Carolina\, this will happen at 6p.m. at Hal
 ifax State Historic Site. \n\nJoin fellow North Carolinians in taking part
  in this historic nationwide observance and hear the words that helped lau
 nch a nation.\n\nArrive at 5:45 p.m. for refreshments and opening remarks 
 before the reading begins at 6:00 p.m. Those unable to attend in person ma
 y watch via livestream.
