 gning of the Declaration of Independence\, PCMH will launch a new exhibit 
 exploring Person County Past from the 1700s to the present day. The exhibi
 t will explore the people and events that shaped Person County\, and will 
 use this as a launch pad to collect more stories of what makes Person Coun
 ty special.\n\n \n\nThis exhibit opens in July 2026 and will be free to vi
 sit during normal museum hours. Funding for this exhibit is made possible 
 in part by a grant from America 250 NC\, an initiative by the North Caroli
 na Department of Natural and Cultural Resources.
