DTEND:20260711T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Step back in time and celebrate our nation’s 250th anniversar
 y at Jordan’s Cabin (211 E Decatur St Madison\, NC)! Join us on Saturday
 \, July 11\, from 1:00–3:00 PM for an afternoon of history\, music\, and
  family fun at one of Madison’s most treasured landmarks.\n\nEnjoy:\n-Re
 volutionary-era dancers\n-Live music by the Christal Creek Band (bring a l
 awn chair)\n-Reenactors in period attire\n-Murphy Street Girls Lemonade\n-
 Historical exhibits and information tables\n\nWhether you’re a lifelong 
 history buff or simply looking for a fun way to spend a Saturday\, this is
  a wonderful opportunity to experience the stories and traditions that hel
 ped shape our community and country.\n\nBring the family\, invite your fri
 ends\, and come celebrate America’s 250th with us at Jordan’s Cabin in
  Madison!
GEO:36.389107;-79.956584
LOCATION:Jordan's Cabin
SUMMARY:Red\, White\, and Revolutionary in Madison\, NC
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/red-white-and-revolutionary-
 in-madison-nc
