DESCRIPTION:Discover what life can be discovered within the Roanoke Sound. 
  Give Ranger Austin a helping hand with seining the sound.  A clear touch 
 tup will provide a close-up view of the critters we catch.  Extra nets wil
 l be available for our young explorers.  This activity will be taking plac
 e in the water close to the shoreline\, so be prepared for a wet experienc
 e!  Get out\, get wet\, and enjoy summer!  No registration required.\n\nPr
 ogram subject to cancellation due to inclement weather/high wind.\n\n330 W
 est Soundside Road  Nags Head\, NC 27959
