DESCRIPTION:Tired of running on pavement? Want to start your fitness journe
 y? Looking for a new running spot? Anybody is welcome to come Run With a P
 ark Ranger! Lace up your running shoes and meet Ranger Billiet at the Trai
 lhead Information Board (at the edge of the trail in the field at the Welc
 ome Center) at 8:00 am for a fun run on the trails! The length and pace wi
 ll be adjusted for the group\, so don’t worry if you’re new to running
  or prefer a light jog! Remember to bring water and dress for the weather 
