DESCRIPTION:Registration required at Go Outdoors website: North Carolina WR
 C License - View Event. This workshop is open to those 16 years and older.
  All minors must be accompanied by an adult.\n\nAre you ready to dive into
  fly-fishing but don’t know where to start? Join our ‘Before the Cast
 ’ program and learn everything you need to confidently gear up for your 
 next fishing adventure!\n\nThis hands-on\, interactive class is perfect fo
 r beginners and anyone looking to refine their understanding of fly-fishin
 g gear. We’ll break down the fundamentals of selecting\, assembling\, an
 d maintaining the right equipment so you can fish effectively and enjoyabl
 y.
