DESCRIPTION:Registration Required at Go Outdoors website: North Carolina WR
 C License - View Event. It is recommended to attend 'Learn to Fly-Fish: Be
 fore the Cast' prior to the this program (10am-12pm same date/location). T
 his workshop is open to those 16 years and older. All minors must be accom
 panied by an adult.\n\nJoin in and learn the basic principles of fly-casti
 ng! This hands-on session is perfect for beginners or those looking to ref
 ine their skills. We'll cover essential techniques such as the basic overh
 ead cast\, roll cast\, and line management\, while gaining insights into p
 roper form and equipment use. This class provides guidance to help you bui
 ld confidence and enjoy the art of fly fishing. All equipment is provided\
 , so just bring your enthusiasm and get ready to cast without worry!
