DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered which native plants attract which pollin
 ators\, or are you hoping to welcome specific pollinators to your garden?\
 n\nJoin staff from the Library of North Carolina’s Government and Herita
 ge Library and the NC Museum of Natural Sciences for a Native Plant Walk f
 ocusing on the connections between native plants\, pollinators\, and plant
  morphology.\n\nThis plant walk will explore native plantings in the NC De
 partment of Natural and Cultural Resources’ Native Plant Meadow and the 
 NC Museum of Natural Science’s Native Plant Garden. The event will take 
 place primarily outdoors\, with participants traveling approximately ½ mi
 le round-trip via paved sidewalks.\n\nRegistration is requested. This even
 t is hosted in connection with the GHL's Native Plant Seed Library. Learn 
 more about our seed library at https://slnc.info/seeds.
