DESCRIPTION:This innovative pop-up exhibition uses storytelling\, illustrat
 ion\, technology and unique artifacts and primary accounts to connect us w
 ith the people and places that shaped the birth of our nation. Simple craf
 ts will be offered for non and early-readers. This exhibition is a collabo
 rative project of the American Battlefields Trust and the National Society
 \, Daughters of the American Revolution. It is sponsored by the Asbury Sta
 tion Chapter\, NSDAR\, in Cary\, NC in partnership with the Town of Cary a
 nd the Downtown Cary Park. It will be the only viewing opportunity in the 
 greater Triangle area this year. Come join us in the lovely air-conditione
 d Gathering House in the award-winning Downtown Cary Park. Huzzah!
GEO:35.783739;-78.780941
