DESCRIPTION:Registration Required at Go Outdoors website: North Carolina WR
 C License - View Event. Participants must take Learn to Fly-fish: Basic Fl
 y-casting before attending this program. This workshop is open to those 16
  years and older. All minors must be accompanied by an adult.\n\nCurious a
 bout fly-fishing for bass\, panfish\, and other warmwater species? This ha
 nds-on introductory workshop breaks down the essentials\, from gear setup 
 and fly selection to understanding common warmwater fish. You’ll wrap up
  the experience by putting your new skills to use during a guided fishing 
 session\, making this a perfect starting point for anyone ready to get on 
 the water with a fly rod.
