  little bit later than expected. On Sunday\, July 26\, from 3 p.m.- 6 p.m.
 \, the town of Bermuda Run\, North Carolina\, will be hosting a festival t
 o help commemorate this historic and iconic milestone. There will be food 
 and beverages\, fun activities for all ages\, as well as live music featur
 ing Alek Ottaway. Admission is free\, but food and beverages must be purch
 ased. Please join us as we take this one last opportunity to celebrate our
  nation's 250th birthday.
