DESCRIPTION:Calling all future Dune Rangers!  Join Ranger Austin and friend
 s for a fun\, educational\, and adventurous three-day camp.  Explore marit
 ime forests\, paddle on the Roanoke Sound\, climb the tallest active dune 
 on the east coast\, be creative with cool arts and crafts projects\, play 
 goofy games\, help with stewardship projects\, and make new friends.  At t
 he end of the week\, you will be an official Dune Ranger!  Our camp is sup
 ported by Friends of Jockey’s Ridge.  No cost to attend!\n\nJuly 29-July
  31\, 2026     9:00am to 12:00pm daily\n\nOpen to grades 3-6.\n\nPre-regis
 tration is required.  Please email austin.paul@ncparks.gov to signup.  \n\
 nThe mission of the Dune Ranger Discovery Camp will focus on the following
  elements.\n\nProvide educational opportunities for our youth (both local 
 and visitors)\,\n\nto promote stewardship and an appreciation for our natu
 ral areas\,\n\nto provide a safe place for our youth to interact with othe
 rs and create friendships\,\n\nto promote an active lifestyle\,\n\nallow f
 or creativity\,\n\nand to have fun.
