  an uneven dirt tread. They are welcome to bring in samples of mushrooms f
 rom their own property for other participants to observe. Place any sample
 s in a paper bag\, and do not ingest any mushrooms found\, as they may be 
 poisonous.\n\nPlease note: collecting mushrooms is prohibited in North Car
 olina State Parks. There will be no foray as part of this program.
