DESCRIPTION:Before the new school year starts\, let's celebrate at Lake Nor
 man State Park. We will have free boat rentals from 12 pm-5 pm brought to 
 you by FLANO followed by dinner at 5 pm and end the day with S'mores at 6 
 pm.
