DESCRIPTION:Join author\, historian\, and retired Ft. Macon Ranger Paul Bra
 nch for a presentation about the Germin submarines that prowled our state
 ’s coast during World War II.  There will be a Q&A session and book sign
 ing after the presentation.  Meet in the large auditorium of the Visitor
 ’s Center. This presentation is expected to last 1.5 hrs.\n\n(*Note: The
  Fort Macon Bookstore keeps a very limited stock of Paul Branch’s U-Boat
  books.  If you would like Paul to sign one of these it is recommended to 
 purchase it before this event.  The bookstore normally has plenty of Paul 
 Branch’s Ft. Macon books in stock\, which can be signed as well.)\n\nPho
 to by Keven Bleck: P. Branch U-Boat book cover art.
