DESCRIPTION:Join a ranger to learn about the fascinating world of wildfires
  and prescribed burns at Chimney Rock State Park. Rangers will discuss fir
 e behavior\, its ecological benefits\, and what we do in North Carolina to
  both fight and promote fires.\n\n**This event is free with paid admission
  to the Chimney Rock Attraction.**
