DESCRIPTION:Join a Ranger for a guided paddle on the Cape Fear River and le
 arn about the plants\, animals\, and ecology of the area. \n\nParticipants
  must bring their own kayak\, life jacket\, and paddle or rent a kayak and
  gear through Paddle NC: https://paddlenc.com/\n\nMeet in the Marina\, nex
 t to the Paddle NC boat rental shed. \n\nSpace is limited to 15 people wit
 h a minimum age requirement of 13 years old. Registration is required. Cal
 l 910-707-6050 or email carolina.beach@ncparks.gov to register.
