DESCRIPTION:Please join us for the June meeting of the America 250 NC Virtu
 al Book Club! We will be discussing Katharine\, the Wright Sister by Trace
 y Enerson Wood  on August 26 at 6p.\n\nThis historical fiction novel tells
  the story of the Wright brothers' path to first in flight and their siste
 r's important role in their journey.\n\nPlease read the book prior to the 
 discussion. We recommend borrowing from your local library. \n\nFree and o
 pen to the public. No membership required. Come to whichever book talks sp
 ark your interest. \n\nMeeting Link\n\nMore Information\n\nSign up for an 
 Email Reminder
