DESCRIPTION:Come learn about the traditional crafts and trades that helped 
 to make Halifax “The Hub of the Roanoke”.  See traditional crafts bein
 g made\, talk with the tradesmen and women of the era\, and discover how p
 eople lived and labored in early Halifax.  \n\nFee for building tours.  \n
 \nFree outdoor activities.
