DTEND:20260830T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Complete History of America (Abridged)\nSaturday\, August 2
 9\, 2026 | 7:30 PM\nMcGregor Hall Performing Arts Center | Henderson\, NC\
 n\nWhat better way to celebrate the 250th birthday of our country than to 
 enjoy a lighthearted review of the history of these United States! 600 yea
 rs of history in 6\,000 seconds! From Washington to Watergate\, yea verily
  from the Bering Straits to Baghdad\, from New World to New World Order 
 – The Complete History of America (Abridged) is a 90-minute rollercoaste
 r ride through the glorious quagmire that is American History\, reminding 
 us that it’s not the length of your history that matters — it’s what
  you’ve done with it! You don’t want to miss this hysterically funny s
 how!\n\nPerformances:\nFriday\, August 28 - 7:30 PM\nSaturday\, August 29 
 - 7:30 PM\nSunday\, August 30 - 3:00PM \n\nFor tickets and information\, v
 isit mcgregorhall.org.\n\nPresented by McGregor Hall in partnership with V
 ance County America 250.
GEO:36.327154;-78.404751
LOCATION:McGregor Hall Performing Arts Center
SUMMARY:Vance America 250: The Complete History of America (Abridged) - A M
 usical at McGregor Hall
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/vance-america-250-the-comple
 te-history-of-america-abridged-a-musical-at-mcgregor-hall-6724
CATEGORIES:Performances & Arts
CATEGORIES:Theater & Musicals
END:VEVENT
