DESCRIPTION:Join us at Fort Fisher State Historic Site for our annual\, day
 -long event about the WWII experience at Fort Fisher on October 3rd\, 2026
 !\n\nGeneral admission is FREE\, no tickets required for entry. Doors open
  at 9:00am and close at 5:00pm. Public programs will be held between 10:00
 am and 4:00pm.\n\nMore information about these programs will be provided i
 n the coming months. Stay tuned to the NC DNCR Events Calendar and Fort Fi
 sher's social media as we approach October 3!
